WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:04.360
When your best friend is murdered 
before your 17th birthday,

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:06.980
you don't develop a keen sense of mercy.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:10.080
Give me your wallet and phone.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.660
For the gram.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.500
Spring break was always sketchy, but this was worse.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.320
Neptune was experiencing a crime wave.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.080
Find out who planted that bomb.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.380
All the money, Mars.

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:40.600
It's possible that these bombings are part of a campaign to destroy Neptune as a spring break destination.

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:46.280
If he strikes you as a mass murderer

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:54.900
Veronica!

